This project is an online platform for a mahjong house rule called 青雀 / MMCR. 

This repository includes several fonts:
- Latin Modern Math
- Fandol Kai
- Fandol Fang

## Third-party fonts

### Fandol

`frontend/src/fonts/fandol-kai-regular.woff2` and
`frontend/src/fonts/fandol-fang-regular.woff2` are WOFF2 conversions of
`FandolKai-Regular.otf` and `FandolFang-Regular.otf` from Fandol 0.3. The
fonts were developed by the Fandol team, Clerk Ma and Jie Su, and are
distributed separately from the Apache-2.0-licensed project code under the
GNU General Public License version 3 with the upstream font exception.

The files were mechanically converted from the upstream OpenType fonts to
WOFF2 on 2026-07-28; glyph mappings were not modified. The upstream package
is available from [CTAN](https://ctan.org/pkg/fandol). The complete license
and upstream notice are included in `frontend/src/fonts/fandol-COPYING.txt`
and `frontend/src/fonts/fandol-NOTICE.txt`.

### Latin Modern Math

`frontend/src/fonts/latinmodern-math.woff2` is a WOFF2 conversion of
`latinmodern-math.otf` from Latin Modern Math 1.959, dated 2014-09-05.
Copyright 2012-2014 B. Jackowski, P. Strzelczyk, and P. Pianowski on behalf
of TeX Users Groups. It is distributed separately from the
Apache-2.0-licensed project code under the GUST Font License, an instance of
the LaTeX Project Public License 1.3c or, at your option, any later version.

The upstream package is available from [CTAN](https://ctan.org/pkg/lm-math).
The complete license is included in
`frontend/src/fonts/latinmodern-math-GUST-FONT-LICENSE.txt`.

